5. Automated Build Pipeline
To compile the entire multi-volume 300-page manuscript including cross-references, lists of listings, and bibliographic citations, execute the following build sequence from your terminal:
# 1. First Pass (Generate auxiliary files)
pdflatex -shell-escape main.tex

# 2. Process Citations & Bibliography
biber main

# 3. Second Pass (Resolve internal labels and references)
pdflatex -shell-escape main.tex

# 4. Third Pass (Final pagination and layout output)
pdflatex -shell-escape main.tex

Alternatively, use latexmk for continuous auto-compilation:
latexmk -pdf -shell-escape -pvc main.tex

